#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:6
msgid "QElectroTech help menu"
msgstr "QElectroTech 帮助菜单"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:8
msgid ""
"QElectroTech has been designed with some tools which help the user and makes"
" easier the searching of information. All those tools can be found at "
"**Help** menu from `menu bar`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 内置了一些帮助用户、方便查找信息的工具。所有这些工具都可以在 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 的 **帮助** "
"菜单中找到。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:13
msgid "Figure: Help menu QElectroTech"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 的帮助菜单"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:16
msgid "Tooltips"
msgstr "工具提示"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:18
msgid ""
"To support the user, tooltips are displayed when the mouse arrow is placed "
"on an icon from the `toolbars`_. A tooltip is a short message which defines "
"the action corresponding to the icon."
msgstr ""
"为了帮助用户，当鼠标箭头停留在 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ 的图标上时会显示工具提示。工具提示是一条简短的说明，指出图标对应的操作。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:20
msgid ""
"QElectroTech also allows the display from tooltips, or short description "
"panels, at many different areas and objects from the main window. These "
"panels are not displayed automatically with the placement of the mouse arrow"
" on the object or area."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 还可以在主窗口的许多不同区域和对象上显示工具提示或简短说明面板。这些面板不会随着鼠标箭头移到对象或区域上而自动显示。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:22
msgid "Select **Help > What's this?** menu item."
msgstr "选择 **帮助 > 这是什么？** 菜单项。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:23 ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:33
msgid "Press on the object or area to display the description."
msgstr "单击对象或区域以显示说明。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:28
msgid "Figure: Message which appears when hovering an element"
msgstr "图：将鼠标悬停在元件上时出现的消息"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:30
msgid ""
"To increase the working efficiency, the description panel can also be "
"displayed using keyboard shortcut. The user does not need to resort to the "
"**Help** menu."
msgstr "为提高工作效率，也可以使用键盘快捷键显示说明面板。用户无需使用 **帮助** 菜单。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:32
msgid "Press ``shift + f1``."
msgstr "按 ``shift + f1``。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:37
msgid ""
"The tool **What's this?** does not give the description from everything, it "
"gives only the description for the different type of collections (`title "
"blocks`_ and `elements`_), the `workspace`_, `project`_ area and a few "
"objects and areas more."
msgstr ""
"工具 **这是什么？** 并不能提供所有内容的说明，只提供不同类型集合（`图框 <title blocks_>`_ 和 `元件 "
"<elements_>`_ ）、`工作区 <workspace_>`_ 、`项目 <project_>`_ 区域以及少数其他对象和区域的说明。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:40
msgid "About QElectroTech"
msgstr "关于 QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:42
msgid ""
"Many information related to QElectroTech can be found at the application "
"without searching on Internet. Everybody who launch the application can find"
" the license text, version of the application launched, developers and "
"collaborators."
msgstr ""
"无需在互联网上搜索，就能在应用程序中找到许多与 QElectroTech "
"相关的信息。每个启动该应用程序的人都可以查看许可证文本、所启动应用程序的版本、开发者及协作者。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:44
msgid ""
"Select **Help > About QElectroTech** menu item to display the PopUp window "
"with the basic information from QElectroTech project."
msgstr "选择 **帮助 > 关于 QElectroTech** 菜单项，即可显示包含 QElectroTech 项目基本信息的弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:47
msgid "Online Manual"
msgstr "在线手册"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Help** menu can address the user to the official online documentation."
msgstr "**帮助** 菜单可以将用户引导至官方在线文档。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:51
msgid ""
"Select **Help > Online Manual** menu item to open the official QElectroTech"
"  online documentation at default browser."
msgstr "选择 **帮助 > 在线手册** 菜单项，可在默认浏览器中打开 QElectroTech 官方在线文档。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:53
msgid ""
"When the application is active on the computer, the user can also open the "
"online manual at default browser using keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "当应用程序在计算机上处于活动状态时，用户还可以使用键盘快捷键在默认浏览器中打开在线手册。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:55
msgid "Press ``f1`` to open the official online manual on the browser."
msgstr "按 ``f1`` 可在浏览器中打开官方在线手册。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:59
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:63
msgid "Youtube Channel"
msgstr "Youtube 频道"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:65
msgid ""
"Many different video tutorials about QElectroTech can be found on Internet. "
"**Help** menu can address the user to the official `Youtube`_ channel of the"
" project."
msgstr ""
"关于 QElectroTech 的许多不同视频教程可以在互联网上找到。**帮助** 菜单可以将用户引导至项目的官方 `Youtube "
"<Youtube_>`_ 频道。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:67
msgid ""
"Select **Help > Youtube Channel** menu item to open the QElectroTech "
"`Youtube`_ channel at default browser."
msgstr ""
"选择 **帮助 > Youtube 频道** 菜单项，可在默认浏览器中打开 QElectroTech 的 `Youtube <Youtube_>`_ "
"频道。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:70
msgid "Support the project"
msgstr "支持项目"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:72
msgid ""
"If the user is satisfied with the work already made by the developer team "
"from QElectroTech and he wants to help the project with an economical "
"donation, **Help** menu can address the user to the official `PayPal`_ "
"account of the project."
msgstr ""
"如果用户对 QElectroTech 开发团队已完成的工作感到满意，并希望通过经济捐助来支持项目，**帮助** 菜单可以将用户引导至项目的官方 "
"`PayPal <PayPal_>`_ 账户。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:74
msgid ""
"Select **Help > Support the project with a donation** menu item to open the "
"official `PayPal`_ account from QElectroTech at default browser."
msgstr ""
"选择 **帮助 > 通过捐赠支持项目** 菜单项，可在默认浏览器中打开 QElectroTech 的官方 `PayPal <PayPal_>`_ 账户。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:77
msgid "About Qt"
msgstr "关于 Qt"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:79
msgid ""
"QElectroTech has been designed using `Qt`_ framework and widget toolkit. "
"**Help** menu allows going to the official web from `Qt`_ project without "
"the need of searching on Internet."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 使用 `Qt <Qt_>`_ 框架和控件工具包设计。**帮助** 菜单可让用户直接访问 `Qt <Qt_>`_ "
"项目的官方网站，无需在互联网上搜索。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/help.rst:81
msgid ""
"Select **Help > About Qt** menu item to open the official `Qt`_ website from"
"  in the default browser."
msgstr "选择 **帮助 > 关于 Qt** 菜单项，可在默认浏览器中打开 `Qt <Qt_>`_ 的官方网站。"
